\v 9 They all¦62328 put¦62327 crowns on¦62327 themselves after¦62330 he¦62333 was dead, and¦62334 so did their sons¦62336 after¦62338 them many years¦62340; and¦62342 they multiplied evils¦62344 in¦62345 the¦62346 earth¦62347.
