\v 16 The¦62467 kingdom¦62468 was established in¦62469 the sight of¦62469 Antiokos, and¦62471 he planned to¦62473 reign¦62473 over Mitsrayim \add !(Egypt)\add*, that¦62476 he might reign¦62477 over both¦62480 kingdoms¦62481.
