\v 39 Her sanctuary was laid¦62878 waste¦62878 like a wilderness,\f + \fr 1:39 \ft See 2 Maccabees 6:6.\f* her feasts were turned¦62884 into mourning, her Sabbaths¦62888 into reproach¦62891, and her honour¦62893 into contempt.
