\s1 The king outlaws Yisrael's worship
\p
\v 41 King¦62915 Antiokos \add !(Antiochus)\add* wrote¦62913 to¦62913 his whole kingdom¦62919 that¦62914 all¦62917 should be¦62921 one people,
\v 42 and¦62925 that each¦62927 should forsake his own laws. All¦62933 the¦62934 nations¦62935 agreed according¦62936 to¦62936 the¦62939 king's¦62940 word¦62938.
