\v 51 According¦63044 to¦63044 all¦63045 these words¦63047 wrote¦63049 he¦63048 to¦63049 his whole¦63050 kingdom¦63052. He¦63053 appointed overseers¦63056 over all¦63058 the¦63059 people¦63060, and¦63061 he commanded the¦63063 cities¦63064 of Yehudah to¦63067 sacrifice, city¦63068 by city¦63070.
\v 52 From¦63073 the¦63074 people¦63075 were gathered together to¦63076 them many¦63079, everyone who'd¦63080 forsaken the¦63082 law¦63083; and¦63084 they did¦63085 evil¦63086 things in¦63087 the¦63088 land¦63089.
