\v 64 Very¦63262 great¦63259 anger¦63258 came on¦63260 Yisrael.
\c 2
\s1 Matityah mourns for his people
\p
\v 1 In¦63263 those days¦63265 Matityah \add !(Mattathias)\add* the¦63264 son of¦63270 Yohan \add !(John)\add*, the¦63270 son of Shim'on \add !(Simeon)\add*, a priest¦63272 of the¦63273 sons¦63274 of Yoyariv, from¦63276 Yerushalem \add !(Jerusalem)\add* rose up; and¦63278 he lived at Modi'in.
